296
00:19:01,440 --> 00:19:03,380
I had a terrible night's sleep.

297
00:19:06,240 --> 00:19:09,640
It was one horrible dream
after another. Hayato!

298
00:19:10,140 --> 00:19:12,017
Just how long are you gonna sleep in?

299
00:19:12,100 --> 00:19:14,260
It's time to get up and...

300
00:19:15,960 --> 00:19:18,577
