You startled me.

302
00:19:20,280 --> 00:19:23,280
Come down for breakfast
and answer when I call you.

303
00:19:27,940 --> 00:19:28,940
It's crazy.

304
00:19:29,820 --> 00:19:30,650
But I...

305
00:19:32,820 --> 00:19:33,702
You're kidding.

306
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:35,057
Why didn't you say we were on...

307
00:19:35,140 --> 00:19:36,905
