Hayato?

309
00:19:41,140 --> 00:19:42,477
Hayato, are you listening?

310
00:19:42,560 --> 00:19:43,640
Answer the phone.

311
00:19:43,840 --> 00:19:44,958
This isn't a dream.

312
00:19:46,120 --> 00:19:48,414
None of what just happened was a dream.

313
00:19:49,180 --> 00:19:50,840
