314
00:19:51,980 --> 00:19:53,392
Everything is repeating.

315
00:19:53,760 --> 00:19:56,837
Somehow I'm reliving the
same morning from yesterday.

316
00:19:56,920 --> 00:20:00,080
Which means that guy's real
name is Yoshikage Kira.

317
00:20:00,800 --> 00:20:02,280
He's behind all this.

318
00:20:02,820 --> 00:20:05,280
This is what he meant by being unrivaled.

319
00:20:05,420 --> 00:20:08,067
He's done something to
me with his new power.

320
00:20:08,560 --> 00:20:09,937
Hayato, what are you doing?

321
00:20:10,020 --> 00:20:13,057
