330
00:20:37,560 --> 00:20:40,360
And for everyone else,
it's business as usual.

331
00:20:40,640 --> 00:20:43,464
It's like you knew she
was going to drop it, eh?

332
00:20:44,820 --> 00:20:48,757
It appears you've returned from a long day
of blasting your friend to kingdom come,

333
00:20:48,840 --> 00:20:49,670
Hayato.

334
00:20:52,300 --> 00:20:53,130
Truthfully,

335
00:20:53,213 --> 00:20:57,417
