details of your little foray today.

336
00:20:57,500 --> 00:21:00,720
But Deadly Queen's new power
is called Bites the Dust.

337
00:21:01,700 --> 00:21:05,160
It automatically protects me
from right inside your body.

338
00:21:05,720 --> 00:21:07,220
So thank you, Hayato.

339
00:21:09,660 --> 00:21:14,484
Tell me, are you even aware that I killed
you last night when we were in the bath?

340
00:21:14,640 --> 00:21:19,052
At that moment, it was as if the fates
themselves had witnessed my despair,

341
00:21:19,200 --> 00:21:22,318
