the form of this ability.

342
00:21:23,200 --> 00:21:28,380
I tried the ability out on you, and
miraculously time reversed course one hour.

343
00:21:28,820 --> 00:21:31,760
The reality that I'd
murdered you was no more.

344
00:21:32,340 --> 00:21:36,620
At the same time, you also became
my personal life-protecting bomb.

345
00:21:37,560 --> 00:21:39,620
You told one of them about me,

346
00:21:39,800 --> 00:21:42,976
