horrors of Bites the Dust.

356
00:22:07,560 --> 00:22:11,207
After which, you'll incinerate
the offender and zip back here.

357
00:22:11,800 --> 00:22:15,741
Your visit with Rohan Kishibe is
now a figment of your imagination.

358
00:22:15,940 --> 00:22:18,528
So now you know the
power it bites the dust.

359
00:22:18,740 --> 00:22:21,280
My true name will never cross your lips.

360
00:22:21,460 --> 00:22:24,342
And no soul will live long
enough to seek me out.

361
00:23:07,573 --> 00:23:12,480
We'll come and stand a little bit
closer, breathe in and get a bit higher.

362
00:23:12,880 --> 00:23:16,940
You'll never know what
hit you when I get to you.

363
00:23:17,520 --> 00:23:24,260
Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I
need you, but ooh, I gotta find you.

364
00:23:25,920 --> 00:23:26,750
Ooh,

365
00:23:26,833 --> 00:23:33,320
I want you, I don't know if I need
you, but ooh, I gotta find you.

366
00:23:37,560 --> 00:23:38,720
I'll break it down.

367
00:23:39,600 --> 00:23:40,880
Let's rock out.
